                "interpretation": "Premium Benefactor"
            }
        }
    ],
    "notes": "All numeric thresholds include normalized byte values for machine processing; text fields remain for human readability. Implementations should evaluate ratio ranges inclusively as described and apply the first matching multiplier rule."
}